  description: Core Reactors were never meant to be weapons. They were designed to
    stabilize experimental E-Core generators during long-term research operations.
    After the Collapse, engineers discovered their resonance fields could amplify
    nearby systems. Today, Core Reactors stand as silent reminders that support infrastructure
    often outlives its original purpose.
  vnDescription: "Core Reactor ban \u0111\u1EA7u kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thi\u1EBFt
    k\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m v\u0169 kh\xED. Ch\xFAng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thi\u1EBFt
    k\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3 \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh c\xE1c m\xE1y ph\xE1t \u0111i\u1EC7n
    E-Core th\u1EED nghi\u1EC7m trong c\xE1c ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u
    d\xE0i h\u1EA1n. Sau S\u1EF1 S\u1EE5p \u0110\u1ED5, c\xE1c k\u1EF9 s\u01B0 ph\xE1t
    hi\u1EC7n ra r\u1EB1ng tr\u01B0\u1EDDng c\u1ED9ng h\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng
    c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khu\u1EBFch \u0111\u1EA1i c\xE1c h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng l\xE2n c\u1EADn.
    Ng\xE0y nay, c\xE1c Core Reactor \u0111\u1EE9ng \u0111\xF3 nh\u01B0 nh\u1EEFng
    l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc nh\u1EDF th\u1EA7m l\u1EB7ng r\u1EB1ng c\u01A1 s\u1EDF h\u1EA1
    t\u1EA7ng h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 th\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i l\xE2u h\u01A1n
    m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch ban \u0111\u1EA7u c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
